msgid "Transcodes"
msgstr "Transcodifiche"

#: wagtailvideos/templates/wagtailvideos/videos/edit.html:73
msgid ""
"If you wish to generate HTML5 compliant transcodes use the form below. This "
"may take a while depending on the length of the video."
